David Murray writes:

>While we're making predictions about the shape of the PPL market, here's
>one: consider anonymous identities in a digital cash world.  An
>anonymous identity can start up a business, etc, and if at some point it
>goes 'bankrupt', well, too bad.  It dissapears, and its owner looses
